# The names of the time zones Rebel carries, from the IANA time zone
# database version 2026f, which is in the public domain. `time` reads it
# where the system has no zone files, as on Windows, or no file of the
# name asked.
#
# Generated, never edited by hand: the Heroes program
# `rebel/generators/time_zones/` read every `Zone` and `Link` line of the data
# files of `tzdata2026f.tar.gz`, held to its SHA-256, and wrote this module
# whole; its `check` command says whether this module is still what it
# writes. The data of each name is in `carried_blobs`, which zic wrote.

# The version of the IANA database the names and the data are.
constant VERSION: str
    "2026f"

# Every name the database holds, sorted by its bytes.
